      "id": "main",
      "type": "section",
      "title": "快速开始",
      "text": "在本地创建项目，连接数据库，并执行第一条查询。",
      "target": null,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "prereq",
          "type": "text",
          "title": "准备环境",
          "text": "需要 Node.js 22 或更新版本，以及一个可用的 PostgreSQL 实例。",
          "target": null,
          "items": [],
          "meta": null,
          "style": null
        },
        {
          "id": "install",
          "type": "code",
          "title": "安装客户端",
          "text": "npm install @riverdb/client",
          "target": null,
          "items": [],
          "meta": "terminal",
          "style": null
        },
        {
          "id": "connect",
          "type": "text",
          "title": "创建连接",
          "text": "客户端复用连接池。将连接配置放在应用启动入口，在进程结束时统一释放。",
          "target": null,
          "items": [],
          "meta": null,
          "style": null
        },
        {
          "id": "code",
          "type": "code",
          "title": "src/database.ts",
          "text": "import { createClient } from '@riverdb/client';\n\nconst database = createClient({ url: process.env.DATABASE_URL });\nconst rows = await database.query('select 1 as value');",
          "target": null,
          "items": [],
          "meta": "TypeScript",
          "style": null
        },
        {
          "id": "result",
          "type": "text",
